"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwp_woocommerce_pre_order_doc=self.webpackChunkwp_woocommerce_pre_order_doc||[]).push([[411],{7410(e,t,r){r.r(t),r.d(t,{_pageData:()=>a,default:()=>n});var s=r(641);const a=JSON.parse('{"path":"/woocommerce-pre-order/guest-access.html","title":"Guest Pre-Order Access (OTP Portal)","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"git":{},"filePathRelative":"woocommerce-pre-order/guest-access.md"}'),o={name:"guest-access.md"},n=(0,r(6262).A)(o,[["render",function(e,t,r,a,o,n){return(0,s.uX)(),(0,s.CE)("div",null,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,s.Fv)('<h1 id="guest-pre-order-access-otp-portal" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#guest-pre-order-access-otp-portal"><span>Guest Pre-Order Access (OTP Portal)</span></a></h1><p>The plugin provides a secure, passwordless <strong>Guest Pre-Order Dashboard</strong> that allows guest customers (non-registered users) to track their pre-orders, check outstanding balance payments, and pay their remaining balance when products are released.</p><hr><h2 id="_1-setting-up-guest-access" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-setting-up-guest-access"><span>1. Setting Up Guest Access</span></a></h2><p>For the guest dashboard to function on your store, two conditions must be met:</p><ol><li><strong>Enable WooCommerce Guest Checkout:</strong> Standard WooCommerce guest checkout must be active. Go to <strong>WooCommerce</strong> &gt; <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Accounts &amp; Privacy</strong> and check <em>“Allow customers to place orders without an account”</em>.</li><li><strong>Enable Guest Pre-ordering:</strong> Go to <strong>WooCommerce</strong> &gt; <strong>Pre-Order List</strong> &gt; <strong>Configuration</strong> &gt; <strong>Guest Settings</strong> and enable <em>“Guest Pre-ordering”</em>.</li></ol><h3 id="the-my-pre-orders-page" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#the-my-pre-orders-page"><span>The &quot;My Pre-Orders&quot; Page</span></a></h3><p>Upon activation, the plugin automatically creates a page in your WordPress site titled <strong>My Pre-Orders</strong> (located at the web link <code>/my-pre-order-list</code>). This page displays a secure verification form. If you accidentally delete this page, simply save the settings under the guest configuration tab again to automatically recreate it.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pre-order/images/woocommerce-pre-order/guest-login-form.png" alt="Guest Pre-Order Login Verification Form"></p><hr><h2 id="_2-how-guest-verification-works" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-how-guest-verification-works"><span>2. How Guest Verification Works</span></a></h2><p>Because guests do not have password-protected accounts, they log in using a secure <strong>Email One-Time Password (OTP)</strong>. The login flow is fast and easy for customers:</p><h3 id="security-privacy-rules" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#security-privacy-rules"><span>Security &amp; Privacy Rules</span></a></h3><p>To protect customer privacy and prevent spam, the portal operates under the following safeguards:</p><ul><li><strong>Rate Limits:</strong> Customers can request up to <strong>5 login codes within 15 minutes</strong> per email. Requests beyond this limit are temporarily paused to block automated spam.</li><li><strong>Expiration Window:</strong> Each verification code is valid for exactly <strong>10 minutes</strong> before it expires.</li><li><strong>Privacy Protection:</strong> If a visitor enters an email address that has never placed a pre-order, the system will not send an email but will display the standard confirmation screen. This prevents random visitors from discovering which emails have placed orders on your store.</li><li><strong>One-Time Use:</strong> A code is immediately invalidated once it is successfully used to log in.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="_3-the-guest-dashboard-view" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-the-guest-dashboard-view"><span>3. The Guest Dashboard View</span></a></h2><p>Once verified, the guest customer is logged into their session (which defaults to <strong>30 minutes</strong> before requiring a new code) and sees a clean list of their pre-orders:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Column</th><th style="text-align:left;">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Order</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The parent WooCommerce order number.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Product</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The name of the pre-ordered item.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Quantity</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The quantity purchased.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Remaining Amount</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The outstanding balance due.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Status</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Shows <em>Pending</em>, <em>Completed</em>, <em>Cancelled</em>, or <em>Ready — balance due</em>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Action</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Action buttons such as <strong>Complete Final Order</strong> (displays when balance is ready to pay).</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src="/woocommerce-pre-order/images/woocommerce-pre-order/guest-my-preorders.png" alt="Guest Pre-Order Dashboard"></p><hr><h2 id="_4-completing-the-balance-payment-as-a-guest" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-completing-the-balance-payment-as-a-guest"><span>4. Completing the Balance Payment as a Guest</span></a></h2><p>When a pre-ordered product is restocked by the admin, guest buyers can pay their remaining balance:</p><ol><li>The customer logs into the <strong>My Pre-Orders</strong> page using an email code.</li><li>A <strong>Complete Final Order</strong> action link appears next to the ready item.</li><li>Clicking the link adds the product to the shopping cart and automatically redirects the customer to the checkout page.</li><li>The checkout page displays the remaining balance instead of the full price. The customer fills in their details and uses any available payment gateway to pay the balance and complete their purchase.</li></ol>',24)])])}]])}}]);